description=冷藏升级的可选Java性能补丁，建议大量冷藏食品时搭配使用。需要冷藏主模组perf.8和ZombieBuddy2.3.4，仅支持B42.21.0单人。由原生食品调度接管，采用原版FridgeFactor/FoodRotSpeed；自定义RotSpeedPercent不在Java模式生效。保留原有物品与付费记录，首次按ZB提示批准。安装、更换或停用后须完整退出重启。 / Optional Java performance companion for large refrigerated food inventories. Requires Cooling Upgrades perf.8 and ZombieBuddy2.3.4; B42.21.0 single-player only. Uses native food scheduling and vanilla FridgeFactor/FoodRotSpeed; custom RotSpeedPercent is Lua-only. Retains existing items/payment records. Approve through ZB when prompted and fully exit/restart after installation, replacement or disabling.
